# evalkit

Run repeatable, dataset-backed evaluations against local agent outputs.

## Quick start

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
python -m pip install -e .
```

This 0.1.0 MVP is local-first and has no runtime dependencies. See `examples/` for a fixture. The project is experimental; contributions and issue reports are welcome.
